      ],
      "title": "渐散的阴霾·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22016001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以我们现在要去哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "随便逛逛——然后看看你到底会不会踩到香蕉皮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不是说了不可能吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "这件事情优纪说了可不算。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江，你也觉得我会踩到香蕉皮吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我会尽量保护优纪，不会让你踩到的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔！！！竟然是这种让我无法反驳的回答吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过我是绝不可能——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "优纪，你看那边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "诶？？香蕉皮，真的出现了！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过这也太显眼了吧！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "所以说谁会踩到这种东西啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过这种东西，随便丢在路边，其他人没注意到很容易踩上去的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "乱丢垃圾，真是恶劣的行为！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "在有其他人不小心踩到受伤前，必须赶紧丢进垃圾桶才行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "还是让我来吧，毕竟优纪你在画上是摔倒了的，就算只是香蕉皮，受伤就不好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不，请让我自己来，正好碰上了，说不定这次我还能直接改变拉斐尔画上的结局？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016018",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "反正我优纪绝不可能……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "要来了吗？主人常说的经典插旗发言。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016020",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜……咳咳，反正我会努力证明自己的。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016021",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不过看起来，好像也没什么危险的样子嘛。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016022",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我都走到旁边也没什么意外发生啊，接下来就只要……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016023",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "优纪……小心！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这，这又是什么？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22016025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗷……呜啊！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-470",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "meishumei",
